            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bake keeps the current masked appearance in the dependent layers’ pixels. Remove Links reveals their pixels. You can undo either choice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“烘焙”会把当前蒙版后的外观保留到依赖图层的像素中。“移除链接”会显示它们原本的像素。两种操作都可以撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
